\f0\fs24 \cf0 Hi! This program has been made on Macintosh and is aimed to Mac versions of SCUMM games. So, while in many cases it should be able to handle PC versions as well, please keep in mind that it might not be stable at all.\
\
For games prior to Monkey Island 2 (included) there will NOT be any conversion of the ADLIB Midi music used by PCs, so the songs might sound rather strange. Instead, MAC music is accurately converted to sound true to the original. \
\
Long story short, you can explore Mac SCUMM games on your PC, and that's the main purpose of this Windows port of SCUMM Xplorer.\
\
Have fun!\
Enrico}